    "No query-specific hepatic clearance or metabolic-stability data are available; L6 records are for other molecules.",
    "No matched oral-versus-IV exposure data exist for the query or its closest analogs.",
    "Transfer from metoclopramide/mosapride is structural analogy, not direct endpoint evidence.",
    "Potential first-pass metabolism cannot be excluded, but no affirmative evidence supports F < 20%."
  ],
